00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:23.820
can do it in a very
consistent way,

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:27.700
so that the consumer side of
it, which is the app developers,

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:30.190
can consume that in a way
that makes sense to them,

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:34.230
and more importantly,
adopt those APIs.

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:37.380
Bala also mentioned
the word OpenAPI.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:40.665
So OpenAPI is one of
those common standards

00:18:40.665 --> 00:18:43.740
which have really taken a lot
of traction in the industry.

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:45.930
It used to be previously
known as Swagger.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.480
So many of our
customers today, when

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:51.390
they start to think about
what an API should be,

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:54.990
they lever the OpenAPI
