00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:35.840
So in this case,
it's pretty clear

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:40.870
that the intent is to be able
to get a specific product out

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:41.954
of the product collection.

00:23:41.954 --> 00:23:44.286
This is one of the key things
which Bala had touched on.

00:23:44.286 --> 00:23:45.580
This is very important.

00:23:45.580 --> 00:23:49.210
If your APIs are not
easy, if they aren't

00:23:49.210 --> 00:23:52.840
consistent and simple to use,
chances are, your developers

00:23:52.840 --> 00:23:55.930
are going to move to another
one very, very quickly.

00:23:55.930 --> 00:23:57.940
I'll give a very simple analogy.

00:23:57.940 --> 00:24:00.640
If you were to flip
out your cell phone

00:24:00.640 --> 00:24:04.300
