00:31:40.290 --> 00:31:42.110
Fair enough?

00:31:42.110 --> 00:31:45.229
So the sandbox area
gives me access to that.

00:31:45.229 --> 00:31:46.520
It's just free, really, access.

00:31:46.520 --> 00:31:48.800
I can just call
the API many times.

00:31:48.800 --> 00:31:52.010
But the staging area is
