00:32:24.380 --> 00:32:25.550
out here.

00:32:25.550 --> 00:32:28.620
It can tell you
where it is deployed.

00:32:28.620 --> 00:32:34.410
It shows you the same
backend URL, which I just

00:32:34.410 --> 00:32:36.390
created for you guys live.

00:32:36.390 --> 00:32:39.120
So this API proxy is
now actually going

00:32:39.120 --> 00:32:43.110
to make a call to this
backend that I just called.

00:32:43.110 --> 00:32:46.050
And you can add a lot of
different kinds of policies

00:32:46.050 --> 00:32:47.880
to make the API magic work.

00:32:50.800 --> 00:32:53.885
So I want a shorten
revision of this API.

00:32:53.885 --> 00:32:55.260
And what I'm going
to do out here

00:32:55.260 --> 00:32:57.450
