00:50:12.480 --> 00:50:15.030
All this, to
reinforce the point,

00:50:15.030 --> 00:50:19.980
is helping you drive agility,
helping you deliver things

00:50:19.980 --> 00:50:22.950
at speed so they can
learn, improve, and iterate

00:50:22.950 --> 00:50:24.490
